  "description": "ToolUp.Facts.Presentation — from a gated fact series to a Fuaran-UI node. A presentation request (trend, breakdown, comparison or table; the whole of what a model may author for a block) and its JSON codec, and pure builders that draw a FactSeries as a validated Fuaran-UI node with the BlockProvenance that produced it. A withheld or absent point is never drawn as a number: it is left out of the rows and named with its reason. And the pipeline block: the request an evaluate_pipeline block part persists, the re-run's wire result and remoting contract, and the grid a result is drawn as. And the requests a stored page names — a presentation request or a pipeline request — in their canonical JSON, with the data a resolution of one carries. Compiled by both compilers, so a browser rebuilds exactly what a server built.",
